{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7d90196dbabc26682637fb819628c659e72c752ba4ee64d356fc465eec757a6c","ja":"……ふう、大満足♪\nごちそうさまでしたー！","zh":"……呼，太满足了♪\n多谢款待——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d88bb131eb44f1b3a23e49156114d87e31abb8e5321b8d112490d3fe178d8e8c","ja":"結局、マコトひとりで揚げナス全部、\n食べきっちゃったヨ……。","zh":"结果，真一个人就把炸茄子全都\n吃光了唷……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4332b3ddd214728bd91c1127ba5b67f0fd932bdecfe6d3b7a86dd89165723336","ja":"実に見事でしたわ。揚げナス職人世界王者のわたくしで\nなければ、揚げるのが間に合いませんでしたわね。","zh":"真可谓精彩绝伦。要不是身为炸茄子职人世界冠军的我，\n恐怕都赶不上炸制的速度了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b9d1508f61f2bb029e8d16d20713ea62ed8bdf6735a5411f49ff60fd2891b62e","ja":"それじゃあ、お腹もふくれたことだし、次は初詣だね！\nさあ、今から富士山に登るよ！！","zh":"那么，肚子也填饱了，接下来就是去新年参拜啦！\n好，我们现在就去爬富士山吧！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ae7ca3e5d854b9fdad757856dfc3110306b8c5487c6515e0e1fe2ff76de07429","ja":"富士山！？　今から！？\nマコト、さすがにそれは無茶だヨ～！？","zh":"富士山！？　现在去！？\n真，再怎么说这也太勉强了吧～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"677a1e820df01262e9420e296765c1154a95bcaf6841c8e0129ad24e768b2fbe","ja":"ご安心なさって、エレナ。真のお友達に\n力をお借りすれば、富士山くらいひとっ飛びですわ。","zh":"请放心，埃莱娜。只要向真正的朋友\n借助力量，区区富士山也能一跃而过呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"435431b293d2640108703078e837e980179e011f8fe3313eb5ed38d1ed3519fc","ja":"すぐ呼ぶからちょっと待っててね！\nピ～～～～ッ！","zh":"马上就去叫，稍微等一下哦！\n哔————！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"693c667987741cc43007574a9ac6bf1ca9867b3ccd7eb346ddf07bbc07d35137","ja":"バサバサバサ……\nピーッ！　ピーッ！","zh":"扑棱扑棱扑棱……\n哔——！　哔——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"712740562bd8e0c50c320b6748568a9a4802092ab2d514e41f666962e5325afd","ja":"え、えええええ～～～～っ！？\nあ、あれって、もしかして……。","zh":"诶、诶诶诶诶诶～～～～！？\n那、那个该不会是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b14907d07d2643ea587ca7df9384ba29c7bc6cdb35441dda65e180d3fb4443ef","ja":"おっきなタカのぬいぐるみが\n空を飛んでくるヨ～～！？","zh":"好大一只老鹰玩偶\n从天上飞过来了哟～～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"fa029f99b5c21319e1cbdf82b57fbb22f967758a271bd5c28a9eeb5260d75cc3","ja":"わあああぁっ！？\nえ、なに、どういう寝言なの！？","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊！？\n诶，什么，这是什么梦话啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4e660f3821292aca8612f897c23eda8c0875bcec08e2804a24a233547074c5af","ja":"えっ……あ、あれ？　マコト？　チヅル？\nぬいぐるみのタカは？","zh":"咦……啊，奇怪？真？千鹤？\n鹰玩偶呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"87481b2e05a474305a3f853696aa62e383ee1d2031fa28bf9164cf73c624af18","ja":"なんの話です？\nもしかして、寝ぼけてますの？","zh":"在说什么呢？\n难不成，您还没睡醒吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b6e272d62fc0b4f06a0e3dcc3563193d5d52ec0bac06aeb7caeb25b32aa4f754","ja":"寝ぼけて……？\n……そっか……あれ全部、夢、だったんだネ……。","zh":"睡糊涂了……？\n……这样啊……那些全都是，一场梦，而已呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1519.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"b1895f524e2ba765fd40b691fa50068e1cd5674957e2b7b01ca66381af7ea773","ja":"……ねぇねぇ、マコト、チヅル！\nワタシ、すごい初夢を見ちゃったノ！　あのね……♪","zh":"……我说我说，真、千鹤！\n我做了一个好厉害的新年第一个梦哦！我跟你们说呀……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
